flowchart TB
    REQUEST[Agent request<br/>Idempotency key] --> AUTH[Authenticate + authorize<br/>Tenant and workspace]
    AUTH -->|denied| DENY[Stop safely<br/>Metadata-only audit]
    AUTH -->|allowed| TX[PostgreSQL transaction]

    subgraph ATOMIC[Atomic durability boundary]
        direction LR
        KEY[Reserve request key]
        WRITE[Canonical mutation]
        EVENT[Durable outbox event]
        RECEIPT[Finalize receipt]
        KEY --> WRITE --> EVENT --> RECEIPT
    end

    TX --> KEY
    RECEIPT --> ACK[Authoritative acknowledgement]
    EVENT -. later .-> WORKER[Claim · retry · recover]
    WORKER -. metadata only .-> AUDIT[Audit + M0 evaluation]

